{"schemaVersion":1,"updatedAt":"2026-08-31T11:52:18.486Z","source":"verified-provider-snapshot","venue":{"id":"j-springer-air","canonicalName":"Artificial Intelligence Review","acronym":"AI Review (Springer)","venueType":"journal","status":"active","officialUrl":"https://link.springer.com/journal/10462","externalIds":{"issns":["0269-2821","1573-7462"]},"identityEvidence":{"source":"Crossref exact ISSN registry","externalId":"0269-2821,1573-7462","url":"https://api.crossref.org/journals/0269-2821","confidence":1,"verifiedAt":"2026-08-02T21:44:44.462Z"},"aliases":["Artificial Intelligence Review (Springer)","Artificial Intelligence Review"],"coverage":{"status":"verified","mode":"representative","maxPapersPerYear":120,"paperCount":14,"editionCount":1,"startYear":2024,"endYear":2024,"membershipSource":"Crossref exact journal ISSN"}},"editions":[{"id":"j-springer-air-2024","venueId":"j-springer-air","eventYear":2024,"title":"Artificial Intelligence Review — 2024","location":"Journal","verificationStatus":"verified","membershipSource":"crossref-exact-issn","volumes":[{"proceedingsKey":"journal:02692821:2024","title":"Artificial Intelligence Review — 2024","publisher":"Springer-Verlag","publicationYear":2024,"series":"Artificial Intelligence Review","volume":null,"isbn":[],"publisherUrl":"https://link.springer.com/journal/10462","dblpUrl":null,"tocXmlUrl":null}]}],"papers":[{"id":"crossref:10.1007/s10462-023-10632-y","crossrefId":"10.1007/s10462-023-10632-y","editionId":"j-springer-air-2024","proceedingsKey":"journal:02692821:2024","title":"A comprehensive survey on scheduling algorithms using fuzzy systems in distributed environments","authors":[{"position":1,"name":"Zahra Jalali Khalil Abadi","orcid":null,"dblpPid":null},{"position":2,"name":"Najme Mansouri","orcid":null,"dblpPid":null}],"publicationYear":2024,"pages":null,"doi":"10.1007/s10462-023-10632-y","publisherUrl":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s10462-023-10632-y","dblpUrl":null,"openAccessUrl":null,"abstract":null,"citationCount":35,"membership":{"source":"Crossref exact journal ISSN","status":"verified","confidence":1,"evidenceUrl":"https://api.crossref.org/journals/0269-2821/works?filter=from-pub-date%3A2024-01-01%2Cuntil-pub-date%3A2024-12-31%2Ctype%3Ajournal-article&rows=180&cursor=*&sort=published&order=desc&select=DOI%2Ctitle%2Cauthor%2Cpublished%2Cpublished-online%2Cpublished-print%2Cissued%2Cpage%2CISSN%2CURL%2Cabstract%2Cis-referenced-by-count%2Cvolume%2Cissue"},"venueId":"j-springer-air","eventYear":2024,"topics":[],"methodTags":["survey or review","prototype or system"],"classificationEvidence":"title-only"},{"id":"crossref:10.1007/s10462-023-10640-y","crossrefId":"10.1007/s10462-023-10640-y","editionId":"j-springer-air-2024","proceedingsKey":"journal:02692821:2024","title":"A novel approach to fuzzy N-soft sets and its application for identifying and sanctioning cyber harassment on social media platforms","authors":[{"position":1,"name":"Esra Korkmaz","orcid":null,"dblpPid":null},{"position":2,"name":"Muhammad Riaz","orcid":null,"dblpPid":null},{"position":3,"name":"Muhammet Deveci","orcid":null,"dblpPid":null},{"position":4,"name":"Seifedine Kadry","orcid":null,"dblpPid":null}],"publicationYear":2024,"pages":null,"doi":"10.1007/s10462-023-10640-y","publisherUrl":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s10462-023-10640-y","dblpUrl":null,"openAccessUrl":null,"abstract":"Abstract This study proposes a novel approach to fuzzy N -soft sets for handling cases where membership degree and grade are not related. In the standard model of fuzzy N -soft sets, membership degree and grade are assumed to be directly proportional. This assumption may not hold true in real-world situations, so a more flexible and nuanced approach is necessary. The proposed approach includes two novel algorithms for decision-making problems involving fuzzy N -soft sets. As a result, it is able to be adaptable and sensitive when addressing uncertainties in real-world scenarios, with a particular focus on identifying and sanctioning cyber harassment on social media platforms. Additionally, an innovative perspective and approach to decision-making problems involving fuzzy N -soft sets is introduced by extending an established selection process that prioritizes the dominant parameter, resulting in more precise and dependable outcomes. Our study offers an effective tool for decision-making in various fields, including e-commerce, social media, and product reviews.","citationCount":3,"membership":{"source":"Crossref exact journal ISSN","status":"verified","confidence":1,"evidenceUrl":"https://api.crossref.org/journals/0269-2821/works?filter=from-pub-date%3A2024-01-01%2Cuntil-pub-date%3A2024-12-31%2Ctype%3Ajournal-article&rows=180&cursor=*&sort=published&order=desc&select=DOI%2Ctitle%2Cauthor%2Cpublished%2Cpublished-online%2Cpublished-print%2Cissued%2Cpage%2CISSN%2CURL%2Cabstract%2Cis-referenced-by-count%2Cvolume%2Cissue"},"venueId":"j-springer-air","eventYear":2024,"topics":["sustainability & society"],"methodTags":["prototype or system","case study"],"classificationEvidence":"title-and-abstract"},{"id":"crossref:10.1007/s10462-023-10621-1","crossrefId":"10.1007/s10462-023-10621-1","editionId":"j-springer-air-2024","proceedingsKey":"journal:02692821:2024","title":"A systematic review of deep learning based image segmentation to detect polyp","authors":[{"position":1,"name":"Mayuri Gupta","orcid":null,"dblpPid":null},{"position":2,"name":"Ashish Mishra","orcid":null,"dblpPid":null}],"publicationYear":2024,"pages":null,"doi":"10.1007/s10462-023-10621-1","publisherUrl":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s10462-023-10621-1","dblpUrl":null,"openAccessUrl":null,"abstract":null,"citationCount":84,"membership":{"source":"Crossref exact journal ISSN","status":"verified","confidence":1,"evidenceUrl":"https://api.crossref.org/journals/0269-2821/works?filter=from-pub-date%3A2024-01-01%2Cuntil-pub-date%3A2024-12-31%2Ctype%3Ajournal-article&rows=180&cursor=*&sort=published&order=desc&select=DOI%2Ctitle%2